  "title": "QUIC: fix handling of Version Negotiation packets",
  "description": "In this MR there are two fixes related to Version Negotiation packets:\n* allow the dissection of sessions forcing version negotiation process\n* fix parsing of VN packets themselves\n\nYou can reproduce the first issue issue with [quic_interop_V.pcapng](/uploads/4ff77a8067ad515b9ff61ebe7a171c03/quic_interop_V.pcapng).\n\nWithout the second change packets 8 and 10 of [quic_ver_neg_missing_connection.pcapng](/uploads/eb6194fee423ed30357d9620cb525200/quic_ver_neg_missing_connection.pcapng) should't be related to any QUIC connection.",
